  "canon:pmid": "15953230",
  "canon:title": "Two cases of amisulpride overdose: a cause for prolonged QT syndrome.",
  "canon:abstract": "Two cases of deliberate self-poisoning with 5 g and 3.6 g of amisulpride, respectively, are reported. In both cases, QT prolongation and hypocalcaemia were noted. The QT prolongation appeared to respond to administration of i.v. calcium gluconate.",
  "canon:text": "Two cases of amisulpride overdose: a cause for prolonged QT syndrome. Two cases of deliberate self-poisoning with 5 g and 3.6 g of amisulpride, respectively, are reported. In both cases, QT prolongation and hypocalcaemia were noted. The QT prolongation appeared to respond to administration of i.v. calcium gluconate.",
